TI  - Pneumonic-type mucinous lung adenocarcinoma diagnosed by transbronchial 
      cryobiopsy.
PG  - e00222
LID - 10.1002/rcr2.222 [doi]
LID - e00222
AB  - Primary lung adenocarcinoma with lepidic growth can mimic diffuse pulmonary 
      parenchymal processes like infectious pneumonia or idiopathic inflammatory 
      pneumonitis. We report a case of subacute pneumonitis refractory to antibiotic 
      therapy and empirical corticosteroids, proven to be diffuse mucinous 
      adenocarcinoma with lepidic growth on transbronchial cryobiopsy.
